  "ALL_TEXT": "87 EXT. ROAD - DAY \nGOVARDHAN walks to the car and gets in the back seat, opens \nhis book and gets engrossed in his Ramkoti. VEDA and \nSULOCHANA sigh and get into the car. The three of them are \nsilent. \nSULOCHANA \nAsalu aa container enti aa \nbriefcase enti \nGOVARDHAN is silent \nVEDA \nAemo thelidhu \nGOVARDHAN \nTheliyakapothe manavenakaala \nenthuku vocharu. \nVEDA stares at him angrily. The BUM, briefcase in hand, \nstands on the middle of the road and asks for a lift. VEDA \nrages at the BUM. \nVEDA \nEvvadra! road madyalo nilabadi \naduguthunnaadu...ekkinchey \nSULOCHANA. \nGOVARDHAN \nekkincharaa! Inko murder kuda kitty \nlo add avuthadhi \nSULOCHANA stops and signals VEDA to let the BUM in \nGOVARDHAN \nSlow ga vella mannaanu kaani aapi \nekkinchukomanaledhu...kavaalantey \nmundhu ekkinchukondi. \nSULOCHANA \nVenakaala kurcho VEDA \nVEDA \nBah ippudu avasaraama? \nThe BUM gets in and sits next to SULOCHANA, and she starts \ndriving again. After travelling for a while they enter the \ncity. SULOCHANA suddenly breaks at a traffic signal on the \nsignal turning red. The red briefcase flies and falls onto \nGOVARDHAN's lap. At this precise moment, the Baba's henchmen, \nwho are on the opposite side, see the briefcase. \nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN \nrey, erra briefcase ra.. \nThe henchmen drive after them on the wrong side of the road. \nGOVARDHAN gives the briefcase back to the BUM. He thanks \nGOVARDHAN with a smile. The signal turns green and SULOCHANA \nstarts driving. The henchmen get stopped by the traffic \npolice. After a few minutes, SULOCHANA stops the car and \ndrops the BUM off. \nCUT TO:",
